@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@token = replace-with-admin-login-token

### Admin: list local accounts with their roles (401 anonymous, 403 non-admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: roles that can be granted (coach, director, president)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: replace the role set of a user (coach + president here)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roleIds": [1, 3] }

### Admin: revoke every role of a user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roleIds": [] }
